{"server":"cn","storyId":"act19side_act19side_sub-1-1","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_s01","title":"困心","storyCode":"DV-S-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level/act19side_sub-1-1.txt","sourceHash":"4a6a2203181ccf7c6046fe650e60b03cbaa7d23cb369269ec8fada1e3708e165","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斐尔迪南为多萝西取来了洛肯水箱实验中回收的数据，可她需要这些数据的理由，却出乎斐尔迪南的意料。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你想要的数据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，斐尔迪南。没想到你会亲自来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了你与政府部门斡旋，我们回收了洛肯水箱的大部分数据。这一点没必要让太多人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......我想了解下你需要这部分数据的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她静静地看着面前的显示器，无比专注，甚至放轻了呼吸。\n屏幕上正在播放一段录像，录像的主角是一个白发女孩。\n大部分时间里，女孩都在睡觉、进食，或者蜷缩在空房间里发呆。\n偶尔她会被领到实验室里，隔着一米多厚的隔离墙，将另一间实验室里的桌椅捏成废铁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是个美丽的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的语气让我想起洛肯·威廉姆斯。我以为只有疯子才会把受试者当成“杰作”到处炫耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，许多人谴责他突破了道德底线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道德？那是庸人为了躲避风险而给自己套上的枷锁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科学本就是超脱常识的。以道德为标准去评价一个科学家，对他而言是莫大的侮辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威廉姆斯最大的问题在于，他被眼前无穷无尽的未知逼疯了，丧失了一个科学家应有的理性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以看一眼最后那段录像，看看这个你口中的“美丽的孩子”是怎么把实验室变成天灾现场的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"屏幕上的画面发生了变化。\n当时的监控器并未录下任何声音，可此起彼伏的悲鸣依然穿透了屏幕，冲击着数年之后的另一间实验室。\n再多坍塌的砖石都掩盖不掉那满地的血色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子......她最后去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与她有关的数据有明显的被篡改的痕迹。很显然，就和洛肯水箱的全部遗产一样，她对某些组织来说还有利用价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐尔迪南，我想找到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我假定你并不是为了继续威廉姆斯的实验而去寻找这个受试者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她太不可控了。莱茵生命无法承受如此巨大的风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她从来不是自愿地走进实验室。我不能提出这么残忍的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你是想治愈她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都不是医生，但只要是看过了整个实验过程的人，就不该再抱着这样的妄想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，斐尔迪南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想找到她，然后......抱抱她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱......抱她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子......她太孤独了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们夺去了她的家人，又将她变得与所有人都不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忍不住想......她现在在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她有没有认识新朋友，会不会遇上新的敌人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好想听听她的声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改变不了她的过去，但我希望她至少还能拥有未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西，你知道吗？你时常让我感到......捉摸不透。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你这样感情用事的科学家很少见。理性同样无法约束你，说不定哪一天，你会变得比威廉姆斯更加疯狂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......疯狂吗？我曾无数次在梦中见过类似的情形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我很想找到这个孩子的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是她还活着......要是有人能从这么悲惨的过去中拯救她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么我相信，假如有一天我当真疯了，也一定会有人来阻止我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
